  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development by reason of the roof alterations, effect of the two storey bulk on the roof pitch and overall massing at roof level, would appear out of keeping, incongruous and an irregularity in the streetscene setting. As such, the development is contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 of the London Plan (2021), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and guidance in the adopted SPD Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
